dio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"23346","synopsis":"Mangetsu experiences her second GRANBELM. As the battle grows more intense with all the girls' emotions running high, Mangetsu and Shingetsu struggle against Nene's ARMANOX, JI GUAN LONG. But all along, another mech is approaching them","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p4FtAxkNzOSfNqEBToAzC4iyj8g.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Mangetsu experiences her second GRANBELM. As the battle grows more intense with all the girls' emotions running high, Mangetsu and Shingetsu struggle against Nene's ARMANOX, JI GUAN LONG. But all along, another mech is approaching them","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p4FtAxkNzOSfNqEBToAzC4iyj8g.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"23737","synopsis":"Nene reveals her identity to Mangetsu and Shingetsu, vowing to fight them fair and square. Then, on the next full moon, Mangetsu and Kuon face off against JI GUAN LONG together according to a plan they devised before the battle, while Shingetsu draws Anna away from them. As shots are exchanged, Mangetsu finally figures out where JI GUAN LONG is","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7tzPsDUVQwjox2JrZLLH6eFFnxl.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Nene reveals her identity to Mangetsu and Shingetsu, vowing to fight them fair and square. Then, on the next full moon, Mangetsu and Kuon face off against JI GUAN LONG together according to a plan they devised before the battle, while Shingetsu draws Anna away from them. As shots are exchanged, Mangetsu finally figures out where JI GUAN LONG is","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7tzPsDUVQwjox2JrZLLH6eFFnxl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"24472","synopsis":"After getting a glimpse of Nene's past, Mangetsu realizes what it means to fight in GRANBELM, but at the same time finds herself with even more questions about it. Still, now she knows that every participant has her own reasons for fighting. Meanwhile, Anna attempts to steal the Fugo family's powerful magic stone, which leads Suishou to give up on her and leave the Fugo household.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ex8oGHXVx3qjy3wYHM6JAlsnAeG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"After getting a glimpse of Nene's past, Mangetsu realizes what it means to fight in GRANBELM, but at the same time finds herself with even more questions about it. Still, now she knows that every participant has her own reasons for fighting. Meanwhile, Anna attempts to steal the Fugo family's powerful magic stone, which leads Suishou to give up on her and leave the Fugo household.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ex8oGHXVx3qjy3wYHM6JAlsnAeG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"25330","synopsis":"Shingetsu learns that Anna's mother was attacked and hurries to visit her at the hospital. She then makes up her mind to find Anna, who has gone missing, and defeat her once and for all. When the full moon rises, the next GRANBELM battle begins, and Shingetsu is faced with a much more powerful Anna... thanks to the power of the Fugo family's magic stone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sQbAw3cWv9g6SNmItDnHGht3WJh.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Shingetsu learns that Anna's mother was attacked and hurries to visit her at the hospital. She then makes up her mind to find Anna, who has gone missing, and defeat her once and for all. When the full moon rises, the next GRANBELM battle begins, and Shingetsu is faced with a much more powerful Anna... thanks to the power of the Fugo family's magic stone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sQbAw3cWv9g6SNmItDnHGht3WJh.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"26127","synopsis":"Mangetsu and Kuon are overwhelmed by Suishou's unsettling aura as they fight her, barely managing to hold out until the end of the battle. Mangetsu awakens back at Shingetsu's house, then sets out to visit Nene after receiving a message from her. They discuss the events of last night's battle, but Nene has no recollection of Anna whatsoever. Perturbed, Mangetsu and Shingetsu hurry to the Fugo household, but what they find isn't what they expected...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/goy4ukmd8KwVovqsX3t0bch9bUn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Mangetsu and Kuon are overwhelmed by Suishou's unsettling aura as they fight her, barely managing to hold out until the end of the battle. Mangetsu awakens back at Shingetsu's house, then sets out to visit Nene after receiving a message from her. They discuss the events of last night's battle, but Nene has no recollection of Anna whatsoever. Perturbed, Mangetsu and Shingetsu hurry to the Fugo household, but what they find isn't what they expected...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/goy4ukmd8KwVovqsX3t0bch9bUn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"27483","synopsis":"While Nene is investigating abnormal magic signals, she realizes that Mangetsu lies at the center of the astronomically high readings. Meanwhile, as Kuon is thinking about her older sister Shisui, who has long been asleep due to a curse, she somehow receives a message from her. She heads toward the location indicated in it and finds none other than the one responsible for the curse: Suishou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/axsBEqD3t6GH2eXR2Vo72p2xVXl.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"While Nene is investigating abnormal magic signals, she realizes that Mangetsu lies at the center of the astronomically high readings. Meanwhile, as Kuon is thinking about her older sister Shisui, who has long been asleep due to a curse, she somehow receives a message from her. She heads toward the location indicated in it and finds none other than the one responsible for the curse: Suishou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/axsBEqD3t6GH2eXR2Vo72p2xVXl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14717","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108147","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39417","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88038","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361704","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"29332","synopsis":"Mangetsu and Shingetsu have been expertly played by Suishou, leaving them unable to fight her effectively. Kuon tries to get them to leave the area and sets up a powerful attack aimed at Suishou, but a moment's inattention leaves her open to a vicious counterattack...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jDjoxQSs5zPq7MjvwQpOwwPVbq8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Mangetsu and Shingetsu have been expertly played by Suishou, leaving them unable to fight her effectively. Kuon tries to get them to leave the area and sets up a powerful attack aimed at Suishou, but a moment's inatten